{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/remote_desktop' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/remote_desktop' data-title='Remote Desktop'>\r\n\t\t\tRemote Desktop\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Center a Remote Desktop window with WinPosStr from screen size, window size, and Windows 8 border totals.","label":"Settings","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/remote_desktop\/remote_desktop","label":"Remote Desktop","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/remote_desktop\/remote_desktop"},"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>WinPosStr:S:0,1,&lt;X_Beg&gt;,&lt;Y_Beg&gt;,&lt;X_End&gt;,&lt;Y_End&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Windows 8 borders<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>Border_T_Width<\/code> \u2014 <code class='inline'>08+02<\/code> = <code class='inline'>16<\/code>\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>Border_T_Height<\/code> \u2014 <code class='inline'>08+31<\/code> = <code class='inline'>39<\/code>\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Position<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>X_Beg = S_Width\/2-(W_Width+Border_T_Width)\/2\nY_Beg = S_Height\/2-(W_Width+Border_T_Height)\/2<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Width example<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>S_Width<\/code> 1920, <code class='inline'>W_Width<\/code> 1024:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>1920\/2-(1024+16)\/2<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>X_Beg<\/code> 440.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>440+1024+16<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>X_End<\/code> 1480.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Height example<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>S_Height<\/code> 1080, <code class='inline'>W_Height<\/code> 768:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>1080\/2-(768+39)\/2<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>Y_Beg<\/code> 137.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>137+768+39<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>Y_End<\/code> 944.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/remote_desktop\/settings\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/remote_desktop\/settings\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/remote_desktop\/remote_desktop' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/remote_desktop\/remote_desktop' data-title='Remote Desktop' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25